[{"title":"雨夜","author":"张鹏翮","text":"甘雨及时催稻花，随风入夜点平沙。\n东陂南陌通村路，割尽黄云万亿家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清贫","author":"张鹏翮","text":"清贫一念永无差，自在安身即是家。\n斗室不惭酣睡稳，焉知人世有荣华？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送人","author":"张鹏翮","text":"天涯相送难为别，况复情深忆故乡。\n珍重前程俱万里，还期鸣凤在朝阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳","author":"张鹏翮","text":"灵和殿下护春烟，想像风流二月天。\n移向离亭分手处，依依青影落尊前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景","author":"张鹏翮","text":"双飞燕子舞林塘，漫卷湘帘入画堂。\n剩有看花春兴在，海棠吐艳欲生香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"莫愁湖","author":"张鹏翮","text":"龙盘虎踞号神都，厌气埋金枉自愚。\n何似鱼矶垂钓叟，一蓑烟雨莫愁湖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清闲","author":"张鹏翮","text":"鹤发苍颜一老臣，炎天未暇息红尘。\n何时高卧幽窗北？\n得作清闲自在身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贡院百日红","author":"张鹏翮","text":"托根不作柳藏鸦，独秀嫣然映晚霞。\n赤日晴曛颜色好，误疑春醉海棠花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨二首 其一","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一枕清凉减百忧，不知日影上帘钩。\n钟声惊破黄粱梦，空羡人间有莫愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨二首 其二","author":"张鹏翮","text":"残红宿雨带轻风，点缀东篱花气浓。\n春意中含秋意在，何须零落始知空！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛丑季夏三日","author":"张鹏翮","text":"七十三龄岁月长，思归未遂鬓如霜。\n一生淡泊无忧惧，乐得清贫晚更香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一枝浓艳向春芳，醉入东风映晓妆。\n不作桃花贪结子，托根到处有清香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斋宿容台归梦","author":"张鹏翮","text":"斋宫独夜正思乡，月色胧胧照玉堂。\n魂梦不知归路远，临风直到遂州阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思乡","author":"张鹏翮","text":"郁郁无聊为忆乡，夜深归梦到华阳。\n相怜唯有川前月，不厌清贫照北堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再过荆州","author":"张鹏翮","text":"楚水悠悠荡月明，轻舠两度暗伤情。\n垂杨不解含哀意，依旧飞花点客程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日感怀","author":"张鹏翮","text":"潦倒乡心此倍生，秋怀无处不伤情。\n那堪薄暮孤舟里，更听萧萧夜雨声！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"下弦月","author":"张鹏翮","text":"嫦娥昨夜罢红妆，淡扫蛾眉朝玉皇。\n掷却玉梳寻不见，西风吹罢碧天长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桓侯庙","author":"张鹏翮","text":"铜罗古渡蜀江东，多谢君侯赐顺风。\n愧我轻舟无一物，扬帆载石填崆峒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"峡行苦雨","author":"张鹏翮","text":"东川一路宿沙头，晓夕江干雨未休。\n莫道天公晴日少，恐将孤月照人愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"筒酒","author":"张鹏翮","text":"水月松风相与清，江城浊酒复同倾。\n醉眠好作还家梦，遮莫邻鸡报五更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅夜书怀","author":"张鹏翮","text":"分水驿连古万州，烽烟无际黄云愁。\n三军不作刀环梦，一夜钲声绕戍楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊凤凰滩","author":"张鹏翮","text":"江光皛皛水云轻，百丈滩头月正明。\n回首荆南人已远，秋声处处唤愁生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石宝矶","author":"张鹏翮","text":"平明别泪洒行舟，山自无情水自流。\n薄暮乡关何处是？\n满天风月上江楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"平都山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"山光漠漠夜云轻，仙井三更月正明。\n一自方平乘鹤去，时人艳说有长生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访何羽圣不遇","author":"张鹏翮","text":"涪江秋水碧云空，霜叶枫林也自红。\n惆怅故人何处去？\n钩深堂在月明中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大渠夜泊口号","author":"张鹏翮","text":"无边落木送残秋，愁听寒涛急水流。\n今夜不知何处宿？\n长江万里一孤舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀两弟二首 其一","author":"张鹏翮","text":"潇潇风雨泊江干，吹落桃花满地丹。\n雁影悠悠云外尽，思君何处倚栏干？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀两弟二首 其二","author":"张鹏翮","text":"水国风生棣萼香，夜深微雨入船凉。\n忆君遥在孤舟里，愁听渝州清漏长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云安道中","author":"张鹏翮","text":"乌啼芳树促飞花，麦陇青青曲径斜。\n夹岸松篁迷去路，炊烟起处有人家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韩忠臣祠","author":"张鹏翮","text":"秋夜澄江月正明，沙场磷火傍风生。\n东流不尽忠魂恨，万古潺潺皖水声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"张鹏翮","text":"昔年曾向帝城游，孤负青山十二楼。\n莫问桃源题咏处，风光依旧水东流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿舌口","author":"张鹏翮","text":"青山面面欲相留，惭愧春风月下楼。\n十里莺花啼不住，片帆早已过沙头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅店口占","author":"张鹏翮","text":"晴光影落半荒台，杨柳春深傍酒杯。\n春色不知离别恨，山花依旧向人开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题田家","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一生受用是田家，弄月吟风傍水涯。\n海燕双飞看未足，绿杨深处有桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白云","author":"张鹏翮","text":"白云遥望北风寒，咏罢黄花泪不干。\n长路关山千万里，只凭雁足报平安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"屹然砥柱在中流，为障狂澜不自由。\n从此朝宗归大海，清江皓月照行舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皋亭道中","author":"张鹏翮","text":"青青阳柳弄轻柔，风惹莺声宿雨收。\n三月皋亭山下路，桃花如锦满汀洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云楼","author":"张鹏翮","text":"流水高山夏日舒，莲池曾此乐幽居。\n断桥碧涧清风岭，天畀烟霞好结庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06