nasty":"清"}},{"title":"太白骑驴处","author":"张鹏翮","text":"把酒临风忆李公，诗豪才气贯长虹。\n荐贤为国谁堪比？\n万古风流感慨中！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16154,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寇莱公故里","author":"张鹏翮","text":"太华闲气产莱公，青史曾传社稷功。\n我亦高山思仰止，楼台无地与君同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16155,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郭汾阳祠","author":"张鹏翮","text":"唐室中兴第一功，纯忠千古数英雄。\n当年不遇青莲荐，空老华山草泽中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16156,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赵城娲皇陵","author":"张鹏翮","text":"尚有残碑志女皇，补天遗石说荒唐。\n亭亭古柏千年物，老干凌云傲雪霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16157,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水帘洞","author":"张鹏翮","text":"飞波千尺泻天风，点点珠玑洒碧空。\n日午洞头寻醉石，不知身在水晶宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16158,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思亲","author":"张鹏翮","text":"思亲到老更情深，偶读邱诗得我心。\n万里路行经半载，一封书到值千金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16159,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣花溪","author":"张鹏翮","text":"梵安随世作低昂，月白风清花自香。\n锦里至今推杜甫，谁知任氏旧山庄？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16160,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆梅","author":"张鹏翮","text":"玉兔园中梅早发，天风吹送到京华。\n枝头几点香生座，漏泄春光是此花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16161,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"署前藤花盛开口占","author":"张鹏翮","text":"紫蕊繁枝绕玉堂，春风乍拂动幽香。\n挺然不变凌霜节，剩有清阴映夏凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16162,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后芍药鲜妍可爱","author":"张鹏翮","text":"夜雨溶溶点嫩黄，朝来淑气媚红妆。\n薰风尽扫狂蜂蝶，独倚朱栏一片香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16163,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"崓山古柏","author":"张鹏翮","text":"远山沿岭自成林，历历严霜岁月深。\n那解移情怜翠柳，春来不致岁寒心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16164,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新春见梅花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"亭亭吐艳作年芳，不畏青霜裛裛香。\n陆凯不来谁赠远？\n义山空自断离肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16165,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日过泰安","author":"张鹏翮","text":"泰山福地逢人日，得意春风动彩毫。\n莫讶岩岩多气象，中台望重本来高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16166,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枫桥","author":"张鹏翮","text":"阊门阛圚接枫桥，几度经过水月遥。\n今日重来忆张继，暮烟疏雨草萧萧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16167,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元宵","author":"张鹏翮","text":"元宵灯火九衢开，薰动阳和淑气回。\n今夜驿亭高处望，一桥明月照行台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16168,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晴日梅花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"寻芳无处醉流霞，独夜空庭一树花。\n正忆游春光福路，画船箫鼓绕村斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16169,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻节苏台梦见大人","author":"张鹏翮","text":"仗节南行已仲春，天涯犹是未归身。\n姑苏台上清宵月，万里西风梦老亲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16170,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜紫薇花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"白露秋深雁影单，紫薇花剩两枝残。\n多情未许风吹尽，留待来朝仔细看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16171,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枇杷二首 其一","author":"张鹏翮","text":"林香不畏荔枝欺，名品由来备四时。\n茂苑城边称硕果，梵云回首叹归迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16172,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枇杷二首 其二","author":"张鹏翮","text":"苏台五日楝花香，东洞庭边枇杷黄。\n为忆赤崖山下树，空垂叶露在穷乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16173,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"羊叔子故里","author":"张鹏翮","text":"清德悬鱼食报丰，志传折臂出三公。\n芙蓉列障依然在，冷落荒烟蔓草中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16174,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饶阳道中思六飞","author":"张鹏翮","text":"路出饶阳忆髯公，花封名在鹤琴空。\n春风回首峨眉月，影落平羌江水中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16175,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"张鹏翮","text":"辛氏楼前旧酒家，橘皮画鹤足生涯。\n子安一日乘云去，槛外空余白浪花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16176,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"紫薇花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"绿阴深处夕阳斜，烂漫还开两树花。\n晴日午风偏觉媚，红霞一片落谁家？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16177,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大文","author":"张鹏翮","text":"蹇蹇王臣昔著闻，立朝正色欲超群。\n平生心事何能了？\n留得西湖一片云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16178,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"翠鸟","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一片空明水月光，碧梧红树映池塘。\n衔鱼翠鸟栏干立，也爱南园草阁凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16179,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家","author":"张鹏翮","text":"禾黍芃芃愿不违，衔泥燕子绕梁飞。\n闺中少妇条桑去，携得盈筐趁早归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16180,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀柔道中","author":"张鹏翮","text":"环山云雾锁崔嵬，雨涨寒泉浸绿苔。\n远望平畴葱茜色，新凉爽气袭人来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16181,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夫人七十寿二首 其一","author":"张鹏翮","text":"江南别去十经春，老态年年白发新。\n回望故乡归不得，相思俱是梦中人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16182,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夫人七十寿二首 其二","author":"张鹏翮","text":"宦情早已叹飘蓬，那及江边一钓翁。\n五亩未营林下宅，不知何地傍云松？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16183,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]